{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/stonehenge-residences-segrex-development-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":495,"crm_id":"325","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Stonehenge Residences","slug":"stonehenge-residences-segrex-development-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","display_address":"Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC)","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"2025","developer":"Segrex Development","price":675000,"display_price":"675K","lattitude":25.0592783,"longitude":55.2019651,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Stonehenge Residence is an 11-storey residential complex from the developer Segrex Development, located in the lively and green area of Jumeirah Village Circle.</p><p>The complex offers furnished <strong>studios and apartments with 1-3 bedrooms.</strong> Thoughtful and functional interiors, designed in a modern and concise style, are perfectly complemented by a neutral color scheme, which makes the residences even more spacious.</p><p>Residents have access to a wide range of amenities that significantly increase the level of comfort: a spacious lobby ideal for relaxing or working, a well-appointed fitness center with modern equipment and exercise machines, a multifunctional conference room, a swimming pool with a relaxation area, a beautiful landscaped garden with a green area. For all household issues residents will be able to contact the concierge service.</p><p>In the area there are several parks suitable for family walks, and the surrounding infrastructure will please every resident: not far from the residential complex are schools and kindergartens, hospitals and clinics, restaurants and cafes, grocery stores and shopping centers.</p><p>In 10-20 minutes walk from the complex are located: shopping center Circle Mall; grocery stores Nesto, VIVA, Bazaar; kindergarten Kids World; JSS International school.</p><p>Due to the convenient location of the complex residents will not experience any inconvenience on the way to the famous places of Dubai.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/325/images/2023/07/04/FskVIL7ly6kBmwj9H8qlKNsKE1aqCG8QRjQRHWlr.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/07/04/FskVIL7ly6kBmwj9H8qlKNsKE1aqCG8QRjQRHWlr.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/325/images/2023/07/04/PKjfOLHKUTmq7Q3JrMqS4Xs3ae4tLArSadNzposx.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/07/04/PKjfOLHKUTmq7Q3JrMqS4Xs3ae4tLArSadNzposx.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/325/images/2023/07/04/Hi2krq4KY3N2PDmj1OZEh380ZwfhrzriQFokrsPE.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/07/04/Hi2krq4KY3N2PDmj1OZEh380ZwfhrzriQFokrsPE.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":1980,"url":"","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1232,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":2196,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"1 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":2197,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"2 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":2198,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"3 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null}],"payment_plan_text":"50/50 ","payment_plans":[{"id":6122,"title":"20%","description":"On Booking"},{"id":6123,"title":"10%","description":"June 2024"},{"id":6124,"title":"5%","description":"September 2024